OL,3,GNEWSAProposals for theatre, hotel and
OL,4,Athousands of homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan for a theatre, hotel and
OL,7,Fthousands of homes aims to make
OL,8,FMiddlesbrough "the UK's most creative
OL,9,Fplace for young people to live".
OL,11,FThe council announced proposals to
OL,12,Ftransform the town for young people as
OL,13,Fpart of its 10-year plan.
OL,15,FThe plans include demolishing the civic
OL,16,Fcentre and building a theatre, which
OL,17,Fwould be equipped to host West End
OL,18,Fshows.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
